  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support the Climate Change Agenda of Guatemala</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Agenda de Cambio Climtico de Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de esta operacin es brindar apoyo al gobierno de Guatemala en la preparacin y seguimiento de la agenda nacional de cambio climtico. Por tanto, esta operacin abarcar temticas de mitigacin y adaptacin al cambio climtico, en diferentes sectores productivos y en diversos niveles gubernamentales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this operation is to support the Guatemalan government in preparation and follow-up of the climate change national agenda. For this purpose, this operation will consider climate change adaptation and mitigation issues in different productive sectors, and across different government hierarchy levels.</narrative>
  </description>
